DESCRIPTION:The Paint Chip Artist of the Month: Lisa Monet Adda.\nVisit the Paint Chip during August to see “A Journey into the Hummingbirds’ Gardens”\, a vibrant collection of photos by nature and bird photographer Lisa Monet Adda. Photographs are available for sale and on display through August 2026\nFree Event\, all day during business hours
